1
00:00:39,923 --> 00:00:45,728
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,736
=Episode 23=

3
00:00:55,039 --> 00:00:55,920
Are you ready?

4
00:00:57,479 --> 00:00:58,399
To disperse your qi,

5
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,320
you must first cut out your heart scale.

6
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:01,679
That scale

7
00:01:03,159 --> 00:01:05,239
is the source of your life essence,

8
00:01:06,719 --> 00:01:09,120
tightly bound to your primordial soul.

9
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,599
Carving it out

10
00:01:11,719 --> 00:01:14,799
is like tearing a rift
in your primordial soul.

11
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,439
The agony

12
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,439
will be a hundred times worse
than the Li Fire's burn.

13
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,079
What's more,

14
00:01:22,799 --> 00:01:23,959
once it is removed,

15
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:26,079
there will be no turning back.

16
00:01:27,359 --> 00:01:29,319
Your ties to the celestial realm

17
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,120
will be severed forever.

18
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:39,040
My mind is made up.

19
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,239
Say no more.

20
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,560
My mind is made up.

21
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:44,840
Say no more.

22
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,439
My Lord!

23
00:01:49,504 --> 00:01:51,968
♪Lies woven from mud and conspiracy♪

24
00:01:51,968 --> 00:01:54,080
♪Trap our fate♪

25
00:01:56,192 --> 00:01:58,944
♪The knot tied between love and hate♪

26
00:01:58,944 --> 00:02:01,216
♪Shatters under your blade♪

27
00:02:01,888 --> 00:02:04,928
♪Pear blossoms fall,
scattering old grievances♪

28
00:02:05,344 --> 00:02:09,024
♪Hidden thoughts grow fierce
in the silence♪

29
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:10,840
I...

30
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,560
I miss you.

31
00:02:16,864 --> 00:02:19,296
♪Bound together by love's dark spell♪

32
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:21,960
It's snowing.

33
00:02:22,464 --> 00:02:29,159
♪Could this illusion of sweetness
last a little longer?♪

34
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:30,400
(You sent Lizhi away.)

35
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,759
Is it about

36
00:02:32,759 --> 00:02:34,520
dispersing the qi
and restoring the core?

37
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,120
Indeed.

38
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:36,800
Your blood broke

39
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:40,240
the seal that suppressed
His Lordship's Li Fire.

40
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,400
(And because of that,)

41
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,639
(your sensations of pain
were once linked.)

42
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,199
Going to the Loong Abyss,

43
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,080
His Lordship

44
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,039
must carve out his heart scale

45
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,800
to disperse all his loong qi.

46
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,879
(And without the heart scale,)

47
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,759
(the seal will backlash.)

48
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,919
(Everything he endures)

49
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,960
(will backlash onto you
without missing a bit.)

50
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:03,560
(Once it begins,)

51
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,199
(no turning back.)

52
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:07,280
Will he know that I'm in pain?

53
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,080
Only the pain is shared,

54
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,680
(not your thoughts.)

55
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,280
(He won't know.)

56
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,280
That's good.

57
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,400
It's quite fair.

58
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,919
Why should he bear the pain alone?

59
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,680
(For me, he gave up his celestial home)

60
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,719
(and his divine path.)

61
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:25,120
(Of course, I don't fear the pain.)

62
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,280
My mind is made up.

63
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,360
Say no more.

64
00:03:31,476 --> 00:03:34,272
♪I'd gladly drink poison
to quench this thirst♪

65
00:03:34,368 --> 00:03:37,472
♪A foolish dream left unfulfilled♪

66
00:03:38,944 --> 00:03:41,728
♪Bound together by love's dark spell♪

67
00:03:41,728 --> 00:03:44,576
♪I draw closer to you despite the pain♪

68
00:03:44,768 --> 00:03:51,136
♪Could this illusion of sweetness
last a little longer?♪

69
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,680
(I want you never to forget)

70
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,479
(that you have a wife bound to you.)

71
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:03,680
(I want to be your reason)

72
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:07,120
to fight with your life to return.

73
00:04:09,632 --> 00:04:11,968
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

74
00:04:12,064 --> 00:04:15,232
♪How tender was our final kiss♪

75
00:04:15,392 --> 00:04:18,560
♪May we never meet in the next life♪

76
00:04:19,392 --> 00:04:22,848
♪Your blade burns with heart's blood♪

77
00:04:22,912 --> 00:04:26,272
♪Piercing through the dream♪

78
00:04:26,272 --> 00:04:28,352
♪You are my desperate obsession♪

79
00:04:28,448 --> 00:04:32,256
♪A riddle without an answer
in this life♪

80
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:39,328
♪Letting you cast the dream into flames
to end it all♪

81
00:04:40,384 --> 00:04:43,840
(Lizhi)

82
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:46,176
♪That cruel deceit♪

83
00:04:46,176 --> 00:04:50,688
♪Let me crave one last time♪

84
00:04:50,688 --> 00:04:53,248
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

85
00:04:53,248 --> 00:04:56,256
♪How tender was our final kiss♪

86
00:04:56,448 --> 00:04:59,712
♪May we never meet in the next life♪

87
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,120
Can't you even work?

88
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,920
Your family committed treason.

89
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,040
Sparing your life

90
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:20,199
and making you a servant
is mercy enough.

91
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,279
And yet you still complain?

92
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,240
How things will turn out

93
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:25,680
remains to be seen.

94
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:27,120
Once my brother wakes up...

95
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,040
Your brother?

96
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:30,680
That rotting flesh

97
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,680
stopped breathing yesterday.

98
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,160
Nobody wanted to claim him,

99
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,120
so he was dumped in the mass grave.

100
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,240
No.

101
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,279
Impossible!

102
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,279
You're lying!

103
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:41,888
You...

104
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,279
Get to work and behave!

105
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,399
You all did this!

106
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,399
Yue Wangshu!

107
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,079
Do you think you've won?

108
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,439
You won't win!

109
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,639
You'll never win!

110
00:06:08,404 --> 00:06:09,839
(Tea)

111
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:10,639
Did you hear?

112
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,959
Lady Wangshu, who was sacrificed

113
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:14,680
to the Loong Lord but came back,

114
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:17,920
was truly made a princess
and betrothed by His Majesty.

115
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,959
It was such a grand bridal procession!

116
00:06:21,319 --> 00:06:23,959
His Majesty himself
arranged the marriage.

117
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:24,879
And her husband

118
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,160
is a true master

119
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:28,480
who helped His Majesty
quell Prince Qi's rebellion.

120
00:06:28,839 --> 00:06:29,759
A monumental merit!

121
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:33,319
Then doesn't that count
as stealing a loong's bride?

122
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,879
Isn't His Majesty afraid
of angering the Loong Lord?

123
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,959
His Majesty knows proper rites.

124
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:41,319
He even sent envoys
to pray at the Loong Abyss,

125
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:42,959
thanking the Loong Lord
for returning her.

126
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,319
They are to pray for a full month.

127
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:47,920
No wonder.

128
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:49,759
Come on.

129
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,480
Zhu Heng.

130
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,079
I escaped.

131
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:56,920
I'm here for you.

132
00:06:57,079 --> 00:06:57,639
Listen to me.

133
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,839
Your father's forces remain.

134
00:06:58,839 --> 00:06:59,879
One call from you...

135
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:01,240
- One more sip.
- All right.

136
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:01,792
Come on.

137
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,199
Drink less.

138
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:05,639
We need to go soon.

139
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,000
Who goes there?

140
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:14,040
What's going on?

141
00:07:26,324 --> 00:07:28,128
(Diligence, Care, Prudence)

142
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:29,360
Your Majesty,

143
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,160
she is merely a woman

144
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,639
who's utterly ignorant of court affairs.

145
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,199
She investigates recklessly

146
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:37,240
and acts completely out of line.

147
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:40,639
Yet I see the evidence
in this memorial is incontrovertible.

148
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,879
Why should the Chancellor's disciple

149
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:44,040
be spared investigation?

150
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:44,864
But...

151
00:07:44,979 --> 00:07:45,639
(Memorial)

152
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,160
Step down.

153
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,079
I take my leave.

154
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:58,399
Thank you for your insight,
Your Majesty.

155
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,360
The facts are clear.

156
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,680
If I couldn't see the truth,

157
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,879
wouldn't I be a foolish ruler?

158
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,319
Yet only a few days into your post,

159
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:12,639
you have suffered much.

160
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,240
Do you regret taking on
this responsibility now?

161
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,360
I...

162
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,360
I don't regret it.

163
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:24,000
Counting the days,
the Cloud Steps should open soon.

164
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,160
I wonder how they're doing.

165
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:26,879
Your Majesty!

166
00:08:28,839 --> 00:08:29,439
Urgent report!

167
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:30,048
Speak.

168
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,800
The convoy escorting Zhu Heng

169
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,000
met with trouble at the cliff.

170
00:08:33,399 --> 00:08:35,240
The criminal Yue Lingluo somehow escaped

171
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,600
and tried to take him down

172
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,559
with a dagger.

173
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:39,159
Zhu Heng seized her dagger

174
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,039
and struck her down,

175
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:42,720
then leaped off the cliff with her.

176
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,519
And the bodies?

177
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,240
Not found.

178
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:46,720
We just received word

179
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,799
that Prince Qi's remnants are moving.

180
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,879
Prepare my carriage!

181
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,519
(This must be the Cloud Steps.)

182
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,399
(Once today is over,)

183
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:08,919
(he will fully belong
to this mortal realm.)

184
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:12,399
Princess Hexi!

185
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,279
Princess Hexi!

186
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,120
Princess Hexi!

187
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,360
Princess Hexi, urgent news
from the capital!

188
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:20,759
Zhu Heng escaped

189
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,159
and rallied Prince Qi's loyalists.

190
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,759
His Majesty is leading troops here

191
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:24,799
and sent us ahead...

192
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:26,679
- Hurry!
- But on the way...

193
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:27,200
Get up.

194
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,240
Let me treat your wounds.

195
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,320
Wangshu,

196
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:09,679
long time no see.

197
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,320
Zhu Heng,

198
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,799
you got out on your own merit,

199
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,039
but you shouldn't have come here.

200
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:18,080
I gave up everything for you,

201
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,440
defied my father for you,

202
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:21,120
and fell to this state for you.

203
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,480
And you say I shouldn't have come?

204
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,039
(Lizhi, you must stay safe.)

205
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:28,639
(Cloud Steps are open.)

206
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:29,960
(Just restore the core.)

207
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,840
(I must not let you be disturbed.)

208
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,056
Young Lord,

209
00:10:37,279 --> 00:10:38,279
don't waste words on her.

210
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,240
Fire!

211
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:49,759
(Come at me.)

212
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,279
(Even if it kills me,)

213
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,120
(I'll buy him time to the last.)

214
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,240
(Lizhi,)

215
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:57,320
(mind me not.)

216
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,120
(Just focus on yourself.)

217
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,320
My Lord,

218
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,320
keep your mind focused.

219
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,639
Cloud Steps are open.

220
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,639
You're restoring your core.

221
00:11:11,279 --> 00:11:13,240
Do not lose focus now.

222
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:19,360
Who ordered you to shoot?

223
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,960
If she is hurt,

224
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:22,159
who takes the blame?

225
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,639
I came here today

226
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,159
to see her,

227
00:11:26,159 --> 00:11:27,480
not to kill her.

228
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,960
Wangshu,

229
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,120
come out.

230
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:06,840
Rebels,

231
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,720
how dare you!

232
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:08,759
Wangshu!

233
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,120
Your Majesty.

234
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,080
Xingyao.

235
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:16,360
Is everything all right over there?

236
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,679
Chen Qingxuan is guarding it.

237
00:12:17,679 --> 00:12:18,759
No one can break through.

238
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,399
So you really showed up.

239
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:26,200
I was worried you wouldn't come.

240
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,840
Trying to catch me off guard?

241
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,720
In your dreams!

242
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:31,240
Did you really think I came unprepared?

243
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:32,896
Move!

244
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,720
Kneel! Kneel!

245
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,600
Uncle Fu?

246
00:12:45,039 --> 00:12:46,320
Soldiers!

247
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:48,159
Look closely!

248
00:12:49,039 --> 00:12:49,840
I,

249
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,320
Zhu Heng,

250
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,279
came here today

251
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,639
only to see

252
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:56,240
my old friend.

253
00:12:57,919 --> 00:12:59,360
Yet your Emperor,

254
00:12:59,639 --> 00:13:01,720
deluded by a demonic loong,
blind to right and wrong!

255
00:13:02,639 --> 00:13:04,720
To sacrifice Princess Hexi
to that demonic loong,

256
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,759
he disregards his own people

257
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:09,799
and points his blade
at his fellow countrymen!

258
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:10,919
Outrageous lies!

259
00:13:11,519 --> 00:13:12,600
Lies?

260
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:15,320
If he is truly a divine loong,

261
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,159
why doesn't he show himself

262
00:13:17,639 --> 00:13:19,320
when you are in danger?

263
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:21,279
Are you all going

264
00:13:23,799 --> 00:13:26,360
to watch your Emperor

265
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,840
be beguiled and used?

266
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,679
I told you,

267
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,879
I came here today for nothing else

268
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:32,639
but

269
00:13:34,039 --> 00:13:35,120
to see Wangshu.

270
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:41,960
Uncle Fu!

271
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,200
Zhu Heng, let them go!

272
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,440
Come at me instead.

273
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:01,919
Wangshu,

274
00:14:02,919 --> 00:14:03,720
come here.

275
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:08,799
Wangshu!

276
00:14:13,279 --> 00:14:14,200
Come at me.

277
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:21,840
Wangshu!

278
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,360
Wangshu!

279
00:14:29,879 --> 00:14:31,759
You are the one I value most.

280
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,960
I came for you.

281
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,200
What about him?

282
00:14:37,559 --> 00:14:38,519
Where is he?

283
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,440
Where is he?

284
00:14:42,879 --> 00:14:43,600
Wangshu!

285
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,919
(Why this sudden jolt of unease?)

286
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,799
(Wangshu, are you all right?)

287
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,799
Wangshu!

288
00:14:56,799 --> 00:14:57,360
Xingyao!

289
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,360
Zhu Heng,

290
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,679
do you think

291
00:15:04,759 --> 00:15:06,639
my pain is still connected to his,

292
00:15:06,919 --> 00:15:08,960
and hurting me will hurt him?

293
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:10,919
You're wrong.

294
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,759
Our connection was severed long ago.

295
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:16,919
You cannot hurt him.

296
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,480
Fall back

297
00:15:28,759 --> 00:15:29,759
and let us go.

298
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,360
Out of the way!

299
00:15:39,759 --> 00:15:40,879
Wangshu, no.

300
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:42,624
No.

301
00:15:48,039 --> 00:15:48,720
Your Majesty,

302
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:51,240
those rebels set fire to the village.

303
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,360
There are people inside who can't move.

304
00:15:58,440 --> 00:15:59,559
I implore Your Majesty

305
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,559
to send troops
to put out the fire first.

306
00:16:07,764 --> 00:16:12,339
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

307
00:16:13,114 --> 00:16:17,611
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

308
00:16:20,850 --> 00:16:25,972
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

309
00:16:25,972 --> 00:16:29,311
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

310
00:16:29,311 --> 00:16:30,675
♪Refusing to forget♪

311
00:16:34,341 --> 00:16:39,118
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

312
00:16:39,669 --> 00:16:41,459
♪He cannot learn them♪

313
00:16:41,459 --> 00:16:44,594
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

314
00:16:47,746 --> 00:16:50,070
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

315
00:16:50,070 --> 00:16:52,433
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

316
00:16:53,011 --> 00:16:55,675
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

317
00:16:55,675 --> 00:16:57,433
♪Their days ahead are long♪
